<title>USA: U.S. meat output 0.7 pct above week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 0.7 pct above week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, March 8, up 0.7 pct at 800.6 million lbs. - USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>08-Mar-97	456.6     6.3	 332.0	5.7	800.6</p>
<p>01-Mar-97	458.6     6.9	 324.4	5.5	795.4</p>
<p>Change:	   -0.4%   -8.7%	  2.3%     3.6%	0.7%</p>
<p>09-Mar-96	476.8     7.0	 326.1	5.8	815.7</p>
<p>Change:	   -4.2%  -10.0%	  1.8%    -1.7%     -1.9%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     4535.6    62.9	3060.5     46.0     7705.0</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     4764.2    66.8	3316.8     52.5     8200.3</p>
<p>Change:	  - 4.8%    5.8%	 -7.7%   -12.4%     -6.0%</p>
